  "notes": "Implemented `deckent audit` + `deckent recover` CLI commands and `deckent_audit` + `deckent_recover` MCP tools. Full ADR-022-V2 CLI/MCP parity achieved.\n\nCLI:\n- `deckent audit <sprint-id>` — runs runSelfAuditGate(), writes gate.json, exits 0 (PASS) or 1 (GATE_FAILURE)\n- `deckent recover <sprint-id>` — 4-step pipeline (audit → IPC cleanup → lock clear → task archive) with --dry-run, --force, --skip-audit\n\nMCP:\n- `deckent_audit` — readOnly: true, destructive: false, idempotent: true\n- `deckent_recover` — readOnly: false, destructive: true, idempotent: false\n\n26 tests passing (8 audit CLI + 7 recover CLI + 5 audit MCP + 6 recover MCP).\ntsc --noEmit: 0 errors in new files (2 pre-existing errors in src/core/config.ts unrelated to this task).\ndocs/reference/cli.md updated with Audit & Recovery section + detailed command reference + crash recovery workflow.",
